    ; range is [pos, end) with pos the full start, and skipping its trivia
    ; gives exactly the token's own bytes.
    ;
    ; That is not quite the reference's node.Text(), which is the scanner's
    ; DECODED token value: an escaped spelling reads as "type" upstream and as
    ; its raw eleven bytes here, so an escaped keyword written where a
    ; semicolon was missing takes the generic arm instead of its own. Recorded
    ; rather than worked around: the field that would fix it is the one 3.5q
    ; defers, and the shape needs an escape AND a missing semicolon.
